  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> be a non-singular symmetric matrix of order <math><mn>3</mn></math>. If <math><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>I</mi></math>, then <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> is equal to&nbsp;"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>A</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>I</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>I</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mo>&#8757;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi></math> (as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> is symmetric)<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>I</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>A</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi></math>"
